{"seq":3,"slug":"smote-variants","title":"SMOTE 及变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/resampling/smote-variants","wordCount":1829,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"smote-及变体\">SMOTE 及变体</h1><p><a href=\"oversampling\">过采样</a>的复制不引入新信息，<a href=\"undersampling\">欠采样</a>的削减会丢信息——夹在中间的 SMOTE 提出了第三条路：不复制、也不丢，而是在少数类样本之间&quot;插值&quot;合成出全新的样本点。这个 2002 年的想法（Synthetic Minority Over-sampling Technique）至今仍是不平衡处理最具影响力的算法，并衍生出一个庞大的变体家族。这篇讲清 SMOTE 的插值机制、它引入的新风险，以及为解决这些风险而生的一整条变体谱系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-在近邻之间插值\">核心概念：在近邻之间插值</h2><p>SMOTE 的做法：对每个少数类样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，在少数类内部找它的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个最近邻，随机挑一个邻居 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{zi}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，然后在两点连线上随机取一点作为新的合成样本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>λ</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{new} = x_i + \\lambda \\cdot (x_{zi} - x_i), \\quad \\lambda \\sim U(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是 0 到 1 之间的随机数。直觉上，SMOTE 假设&quot;两个相近的少数类样本之间的区域也应属于少数类&quot;，于是往这片区域填充新点，把少数类从孤立的散点扩展成连续的&quot;带&quot;。相比 ROS 的精确复制，这些合成点各不相同，减轻了<a href=\"oversampling\">过采样</a>里讲的那种边界紧贴训练点的过拟合。</p>\n<p>但这个&quot;两点之间也是少数类&quot;的假设，正是它一切问题的根源：如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和它的邻居分属不同子概念、或其中一个是噪声、或连线穿过了多数类区域，插出的新点就会落在错误的地方，制造<a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-failure-modes\">失效模式</a>所说的噪声放大与类别重叠。整个变体家族，本质都是在修补这个假设。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  SMOTE[基础 SMOTE&lt;br/&gt;少数类近邻间均匀插值] --&gt; Q1{插值区域可靠吗?}&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|边界更该加密| BL[Borderline-SMOTE&lt;br/&gt;只在危险边界点插值]&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|难学样本该多插| ADA[ADASYN&lt;br/&gt;按学习难度自适应密度]&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|含类别特征| NC[SMOTENC / SMOTEN&lt;br/&gt;处理离散特征]&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|子簇结构| KM[KMeans-SMOTE&lt;br/&gt;先聚类再簇内插值]&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|SVM 边界| SV[SVMSMOTE&lt;br/&gt;沿支持向量插值]&#10;  SMOTE --&gt; CleanQ{合成后清洗?}&#10;  CleanQ --&gt; ST[SMOTE-Tomek&lt;br/&gt;删边界纠缠对]&#10;  CleanQ --&gt; SE[SMOTE-ENN&lt;br/&gt;删被邻居否决点]\">flowchart TD\n  SMOTE[基础 SMOTE&lt;br/&gt;少数类近邻间均匀插值] --&gt; Q1{插值区域可靠吗?}\n  Q1 --&gt;|边界更该加密| BL[Borderline-SMOTE&lt;br/&gt;只在危险边界点插值]\n  Q1 --&gt;|难学样本该多插| ADA[ADASYN&lt;br/&gt;按学习难度自适应密度]\n  Q1 --&gt;|含类别特征| NC[SMOTENC / SMOTEN&lt;br/&gt;处理离散特征]\n  Q1 --&gt;|子簇结构| KM[KMeans-SMOTE&lt;br/&gt;先聚类再簇内插值]\n  Q1 --&gt;|SVM 边界| SV[SVMSMOTE&lt;br/&gt;沿支持向量插值]\n  SMOTE --&gt; CleanQ{合成后清洗?}\n  CleanQ --&gt; ST[SMOTE-Tomek&lt;br/&gt;删边界纠缠对]\n  CleanQ --&gt; SE[SMOTE-ENN&lt;br/&gt;删被邻居否决点]</pre><p>下表梳理主要变体各自解决什么问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变体</th>\n<th>核心改进</th>\n<th>针对的问题</th>\n<th>何时选用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SMOTE</td>\n<td>近邻均匀插值</td>\n<td>复制过拟合</td>\n<td>数值特征、基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Borderline-SMOTE</td>\n<td>只加密边界危险点</td>\n<td>内部插值浪费/重叠</td>\n<td>边界模糊时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADASYN</td>\n<td>难学样本插更多</td>\n<td>各区域难度不均</td>\n<td>局部难度差异大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SMOTENC</td>\n<td>数值+类别混合</td>\n<td>类别特征无法插值</td>\n<td>表格含离散列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SMOTEN</td>\n<td>纯类别特征</td>\n<td>全离散数据</td>\n<td>全类别特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KMeans-SMOTE</td>\n<td>簇内插值</td>\n<td><a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-failure-modes\">小析取项</a></td>\n<td>少数类多子群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SMOTE-Tomek / ENN</td>\n<td>合成后清洗</td>\n<td>噪声/重叠放大</td>\n<td>需要干净边界</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"borderline-smote-与-adasyn-把力气花在刀刃上\">Borderline-SMOTE 与 ADASYN：把力气花在刀刃上</h2><p>基础 SMOTE 对所有少数类样本一视同仁地插值，但直觉告诉我们：远离边界、深处少数类内部的样本本就分得清，往那儿插新点是浪费；真正需要加密的是骑在边界上、容易被误判的样本。</p>\n<p><strong>Borderline-SMOTE</strong> 正是这个思路。它先判断每个少数类样本的&quot;危险程度&quot;：看它的近邻里有多少属于多数类。如果一个少数类样本的邻居大部分是多数类，说明它在边界上、很危险，只对这类&quot;边界样本&quot;做插值；邻居几乎全是多数类的则视为噪声直接跳过。这样合成的新点集中在决策边界附近，更有效地帮模型撑开边界。</p>\n<p><strong>ADASYN</strong>（Adaptive Synthetic Sampling）用一个连续的权重把这个思想推得更远：为每个少数类样本计算一个难度分数——它的近邻里多数类占比越高，说明越难学，就为它合成越多的新样本。于是合成密度自适应地向&quot;难学区域&quot;倾斜。Borderline-SMOTE 是硬性地二分（边界点插、非边界点不插），ADASYN 是软性地按难度连续分配。二者的共同风险是：都更依赖近邻里的多数类比例，因此对噪声更敏感——一个标注错误的多数类点会把周围区域误判为&quot;危险/难学&quot;而过度加密。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处理类别特征-smotenc-与-smoten\">处理类别特征：SMOTENC 与 SMOTEN</h2><p>基础 SMOTE 有一个常被忽略的硬伤：它在两点连线上插值，这只对<strong>数值特征</strong>有意义。对&quot;城市&quot;这样的类别特征，&quot;北京&quot;和&quot;上海&quot;之间取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 会插出一个不存在的中间值，纯属胡来。这正是<a href=\"oversampling\">过采样篇</a>提醒过的——含类别特征时不能盲目 SMOTE。</p>\n<p><strong>SMOTENC</strong>（Nominal and Continuous）为混合特征而设计：数值列照常插值，类别列则改用&quot;取近邻中的众数&quot;来赋值，从而生成合法的类别取值。<strong>SMOTEN</strong> 则针对全部是类别特征的数据，用基于值重叠的距离度量找近邻、用众数投票合成。选择哪个取决于特征构成：全数值用 SMOTE，数值+类别混合用 SMOTENC，纯类别用 SMOTEN。在动手前先明确特征类型，是避免造出垃圾样本的第一步——这也和<a href=\"../../feature-engineering/feature-basics/data-types-encoding\">特征工程</a>里对编码的处理紧密相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kmeans-smote-与合成后清洗\">KMeans-SMOTE 与合成后清洗</h2><p>针对少数类不是一整块、而是碎成多个小簇（<a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-failure-modes\">失效模式</a>里的&quot;小析取项&quot;），<strong>KMeans-SMOTE</strong> 先对数据聚类，只在&quot;少数类占比高&quot;的簇内部做 SMOTE，并按簇的稀疏程度分配合成量。这避免了基础 SMOTE 跨簇插值（在两个本不相连的少数类子群之间连线，穿过多数类区域造出错误样本）的问题，对类内不平衡尤其有效。<strong>SVMSMOTE</strong> 则借助 SVM 找出支持向量，沿着这些最能定义边界的样本插值。</p>\n<p>无论哪种插值，都可能造出落在多数类区域的&quot;坏点&quot;。于是有了<strong>合成后清洗</strong>的组合拳：<strong>SMOTE-Tomek</strong> 在 SMOTE 之后用 <a href=\"undersampling\">Tomek Links</a> 删掉骑在边界上互相矛盾的样本对；<strong>SMOTE-ENN</strong> 用 <a href=\"undersampling\">ENN</a> 删掉被近邻多数投票否决的样本，清洗力度更大。二者是 imbalanced-learn 里 <code>combine</code> 子模块的两员主力，也是<a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-failure-modes\">失效模式</a>里&quot;噪声放大&quot;那节推荐的解药。一个务实的默认选择：表格数据先试 <code>SMOTE</code> 或 <code>SMOTE-ENN</code>，含类别特征换 <code>SMOTENC</code>，少数类明显分群则上 <code>KMeans-SMOTE</code>。</p>\n<p>需要牢记的边界：无论用哪个变体，SMOTE 都<strong>只能在训练折内执行</strong>，且会扭曲概率校准——对绝对稀少（只有几十个少数类样本）它也无能为力，因为它造不出真正的新形态，只在已有点之间填空。这些约束分别在<a href=\"../practice/resampling-pitfalls\">重采样陷阱</a>和<a href=\"../foundations/why-imbalance-hard\">为何不平衡难</a>里展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SMOTE 在少数类近邻之间线性插值合成新样本，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{new}=x_i+\\lambda(x_{zi}-x_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 打破 ROS 的精确复制、缓解过拟合。</li>\n<li>它的核心假设&quot;两个相近少数类点之间也是少数类&quot;是一切风险的根源；整个变体家族都在修补它。</li>\n<li>Borderline-SMOTE 只加密边界危险点、ADASYN 按学习难度自适应分配——都更聚焦边界但对噪声更敏感。</li>\n<li>含类别特征必须用 SMOTENC/SMOTEN，否则插出非法取值；少数类分群用 KMeans-SMOTE 避免跨簇插值。</li>\n<li>SMOTE-Tomek / SMOTE-ENN 在合成后清洗坏点，是噪声放大的解药；但所有变体都只能在训练折内做，且对绝对稀少无能为力。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"oversampling\">过采样</a> · <a href=\"undersampling\">欠采样</a> · <a href=\"../algorithm/cost-sensitive\">代价敏感学习</a> · <a href=\"../practice/resampling-pitfalls\">重采样陷阱</a> · <a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-failure-modes\">失效模式</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../feature-engineering/feature-basics/data-types-encoding\">特征工程 · 数据类型与编码</a> —— SMOTENC 处理类别特征的方式，取决于上游如何编码离散变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>数据来源：imbalanced-learn 0.14.2（2026-06-07）的 <code>over_sampling</code> 与 <code>combine</code> 子模块提供 SMOTE、BorderlineSMOTE、ADASYN、SMOTENC、SMOTEN、KMeansSMOTE、SVMSMOTE、SMOTETomek、SMOTEENN；0.14 起 SMOTE 系 <code>n_jobs</code> 参数被弃用，见 <a href=\"https://imbalanced-learn.org/stable/whats_new.html\">Release history</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SMOTE 及变体","id":"smote-及变体"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：在近邻之间插值","id":"核心概念-在近邻之间插值"},{"level":2,"text":"Borderline-SMOTE 与 ADASYN：把力气花在刀刃上","id":"borderline-smote-与-adasyn-把力气花在刀刃上"},{"level":2,"text":"处理类别特征：SMOTENC 与 SMOTEN","id":"处理类别特征-smotenc-与-smoten"},{"level":2,"text":"KMeans-SMOTE 与合成后清洗","id":"kmeans-smote-与合成后清洗"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"欠采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/resampling/undersampling"},"next":{"title":"代价敏感学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/algorithm/cost-sensitive"}}